{"unit_id": "tag:03LC:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的一个态射（morphism）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 命题<REF_0001>中的范畴（categories）等价（equivalences）与拉回（pullback）相容（compatible）。更确切地说，有<MATH_0002>，对任意拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）<MATH_0003>，它在<MATH_0004>上，均成立。\n<STRUCT_0003> 命题<REF_0002>第（1）项中的范畴（categories）等价（equivalences）一般<TEXTBFOPEN_0001>不<TEXTBFCLOSE_0001>与推前（pushforward）相容（compatible）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 若<MATH_0005>是拟紧的（quasi-compact）且拟分离的（quasi-separated），并且<MATH_0006>，则<MATH_0007>与<MATH_0008>保持拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves），且图（diagram）\n<MATH_0009>\n是交换的（commutative），即<MATH_0010>。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "equivalences", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "compatible", "target_term": "相容"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "equivalences", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "pushforward", "target_term": "推前"}, {"source_term": "compatible", "target_term": "相容"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射涉及的概形，待批准"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "概形态射，待批准"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "拟凝聚层的范畴，待批准"}, {"source_term": "equivalences", "target_term": "等价", "context": "范畴之间的等价，待批准"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回", "context": "拟凝聚层的拉回，待批准"}, {"source_term": "compatible", "target_term": "相容", "context": "范畴等价与