{"unit_id": "tag:071N:proof", "translation": "我们对平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑（topology）证明此事；Zariski拓扑（topology）情形的证明略去。由概形上同调（Cohomology of Schemes），引理<REF_0001>，层（sheaves）<MATH_0001>是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent），因此这一断言有意义。层（sheaf）<MATH_0002>是与预层（presheaf）\n<MATH_0003>\n关联的层（sheaf），其中<MATH_0004>为<MATH_0005>的一个对象（object），见景上上同调（Cohomology on Sites），引理<REF_0002>。按照我们的约定，右侧是平展上同调（<ACCENT_0002>tale cohomology），针对的是<MATH_0006>在局部化（localization）<MATH_0007>上的限制（restriction），而该局部化等于<MATH_0008>。由命题<REF_0003>，这一预层（presheaf）与预层（presheaf）\n<MATH_0009>\n相同，其中<MATH_0010>为投影（projection）。若<MATH_0011>是仿射的（affine），则它与<MATH_0012>相同，见概形上同调（Cohomology of Schemes），引理<REF_0004>。由概形上同调（Cohomology of Schemes），引理<REF_0005>，它等于<MATH_0013>，后者是<MATH_0014>在<MATH_0015>上的取值（value）。因此，模（modules）层（sheaves）<MATH_0016>与<MATH_0017>在<MATH_0018>的每个仿射的（affine）对象（object）上的取值（values）是典范同构的（canonically isomorphic），这蕴含它们是典范同构的（canonically isomorphic）。\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology of Schemes", "target_term": "概形上同调"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology on Sites", "target_term": "景上上同调"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0002>tale cohomology", "target_term": "平展上同调"}, {"source_term": "localization", "target_term": "局部化"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "projection", "target_term": "投影"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology of Schemes", "target_term": "概形上同调"}, {